{"question_id":"1lgswyy0y","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 11th April Evening Shift","year":2023,"subject":"physics","chapter":"laws-of-motion","chapterGroup":"mechanics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"content":"<p>A body of mass <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.466ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.882ex\" height=\"2.163ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2600 956\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> moves along <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.195ex\" height=\"0.975ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 528 431\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"78\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-78\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-axis such that it's velocity varies with displacement <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.195ex\" height=\"0.975ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 528 431\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"78\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-78\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> according to the relation <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.866ex\" height=\"2.473ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -843 6570.6 1093\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(762.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1818.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(2818.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,-17)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"572\" height=\"60\" x=\"853\" y=\"723\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4243.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5676.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6176.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> the force acting on the body is:-</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"166 N"},{"identifier":"B","content":"5 N"},{"identifier":"C","content":"25 N"},{"identifier":"D","content":"125 N"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"Given that the velocity of the body varies with displacement x according to the relation:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.491ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.987ex\" height=\"2.398ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -843 6624.2 1060\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(762.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1818.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(2818.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,-17)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"572\" height=\"60\" x=\"853\" y=\"723\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4243.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(4410.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1260,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nTo find the force acting on the body, we first need to find its acceleration, which can be obtained by differentiating the velocity with respect to time. However, we don't have the velocity expressed as a function of time, but rather as a function of displacement. To work around this, we will use the chain rule:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.754ex\" height=\"2.8ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 5637.3 1237.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(263.8,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"912.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1430.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2486.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(250.8,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"974.3\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3922.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(4423,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(294.6,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"974.3\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nNow, differentiate the velocity with respect to displacement:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27.492ex\" height=\"2.819ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -893.3 12151.4 1246.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(250.8,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"974.3\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1492.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2547.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3563.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4063.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5286.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(5786.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(605,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8329.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(9385.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(9885.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(605,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nRecall that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.747ex\" height=\"2.8ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -884.7 1214.3 1237.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(294.6,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"974.3\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the velocity, so we have:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24.283ex\" height=\"2.819ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -893.3 10733.1 1246.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(263.8,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(523,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D461\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D461\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"912.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1430.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2486.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2986.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(605,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5474.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5974.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\" transform=\"translate(6974.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,-17)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"572\" height=\"60\" x=\"853\" y=\"723\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8677.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(9733.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nThus, the acceleration is constant and equal to 50 m/s\u00b2.\n\nNow we can find the force acting on the body using Newton's second law:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.895ex\" height=\"1.563ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -680 3489.6 691\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1026.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2082.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2960.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nFirst, convert the mass from grams to kilograms:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.816ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18.189ex\" height=\"2.98ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -956.6 8039.3 1317.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1155.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2211.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,485.7) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(1500,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1736.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(303.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g><rect width=\"1781.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4510.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5566.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(6844.3,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(7011.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nNow, calculate the force:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28.83ex\" height=\"2.452ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 12742.8 1083.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1026.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJ